# ============================================================================
# Codex-Turnloom — repository hygiene
# Only source, docs intended for users, and release metadata belong in git.
# Local build output, QA evidence, machine state and credentials never do.
# ============================================================================

# Dependencies & runtime caches
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
**/.expo/
**/dist/
**/web-build/
**/.gradle/
dist-desktop/
desktop/assets/runtime/
coverage/
tmp/
temp/
*.tgz

# Logs, temp & editor/OS noise
*.log
npm-debug.log*
*.tmp
*.bak
*.orig
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# Secrets & machine-local configuration
.env
.env.*
config.local.json
*.jks
*.keystore
android/local.properties
AGENTS.md
!mobile-app/src/constants/optionA.ts

# Private working memory / deployment records (never public)
docs/PROJECT_MEMORY.md
docs/OPERATIONS.md
docs/OPERATIONS-CHANGELOG.md

# QA evidence: generated locally, must not be committed
docs/option-a/qa-shots/
docs/option-a/qa-scripts/
docs/option-a/coordination/
docs/option-a/report-assets/
public/option-a/report/report-assets/*
